### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manish",
  "email": "manish@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "manish@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

